# Prose. These documents are hand-wrapped on purpose and prettier's markdown
# printer actively damages them: it re-pads every table cell to the widest one
# (so a one-word edit rewrites the whole table) and it strips the two-space
# indent that continues a wrapped list item, which breaks the list. The doctrine
# in AGENTS.project.md is meant to be read in a diff. Leave it alone.
**/*.md
